filenumber 632815
! STAGE 2 -- two-zone initial permeability, consistent bounds.
! Cell: parent 1807 | sigmainit 27.99 | fluid B | permev F
! Built from res632522.in, which is the (30.0, A, T/F) cell of this slice.
!
! MAP: "perm_2zone_601_ds5_kmax2.5e-13.txt"
!   near-well 150 m disc = kpmax = 2.5e-13
!   background           = kp = kpmin = 1e-15
!   The map's two values ARE the evolution bounds -- nothing else appears.
!   Of 112 archived runs with enhancement and a nonuniform map, the 35
!   obeying this had 29 reach dc; the 77 that did not had 2.
!
! permev F: enhancement OFF -- the conduit is the initial condition only. With a
!   two-zone field this is a real alternative model, not a degenerate case:
!   it asks whether slip needs to extend the conduit at all.
!
! fluid B: eta 1.27e-4, beta 1.5768e-07  (beta x 7.007874 so D is unchanged from A)
!   Holding D fixed is NOT a null change: the Peaceman well index
!   T = 2*pi*k/eta (m_diffusion.f90:669) depends on eta alone, so the
!   wellbore coupling gamma = (Sw_fwid/h)/((Sw_fwid/h)+T) shifts.
!   Also phi*beta = 1.577e-09, ~3.9x above what phi<=0.02 and
!   beta<=2e-8 allow. Deliberate, for diffusivity consistency.
!
! sigmainit 27.99 MPa  (DERIVED: sv 100, sH 160, dip 10 deg, p_pore 73.82 -> 27.99)
! tau0 = 10.36 MPa (Taiyi 15.0)   dp_crit = 10.73 MPa
! Peak MEASURED downhole overpressure in 5 d is 10.92 MPa, so this cell CAN
! fail at the observed pressure.
!
! tmax 0.01369863 yr = 5.00 d. res632522.in ran 8 d; both cover the 0-5 d
! comparison window that every score uses.
problem 3dp
imax 601
jmax 601
ds 0.005
interval 30
nstep 40000
tmax 0.01369863
dtmax 43200
dtout 0.0002
parameterfromfile T
parameter_file "perm_2zone_601_ds5_kmax2.5e-13.txt"
parameter_file_ncol 1
backslip T
vpl 0d0
a 0.015
b 0.012
dc 1e-4
f0 0.6
muinit 0.37
sigmainit 27.99
velinit 1d-12
limitsigma T
minsig 1
velmin 1d-20
pressurediffusion T
permev F
kpmax 2.5e-13
kpmin 1e-15
kp 1e-15
phi 0.01
beta 1.5768e-07
eta 1.27e-4
kL 1e-3
kT 1e15
pfinit 0d0
bcl Dirichlet
bcr Dirichlet
bct Dirichlet
bcb Dirichlet
pbcl 0d0
pbcr 0d0
pbct 0d0
pbcb 0d0
injectionfromfile T
injection_file "june_clean.txt"
rigid 24
Sw_fwid 7.4e-9
rw 8.9e-2
